{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1000_010azu", "source_sha256": "7a3753a486ff8de3defd7ea0e0620195527b6a7393e407ab2ed72312df4a3ef1", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さ～ん♪\nPVの撮影、いま休憩に入りました～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生～♪\nPV拍摄工作进入休息时间了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b105ca8aace17d85b36e108c20d0a04ff8105c9a42a94fa2c082314f77ce663a", "ja": "お疲れ様です、あずささん。\n順調ですね。カフェの雰囲気ばっちりですよ！", "zh": "辛苦了，梓小姐。\n拍摄工作很顺利呢，咖啡厅的气氛十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "7bd317da0824599b84fc6aaad8407e6fa0e42062d877dbf791902d352944b5ab", "ja": "まぁ。{$P$}さんにそう言って\nいただけて、よかったです。", "zh": "哎呀，听到{$P$}先生这么说，\n真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "e7c3dbd233afe8c5fbaeed2cb390e5aca73b82682eb9e71afe302454785cfe13", "ja": "今回の撮影のためにコーヒーの淹れ方を、豆を挽く\nところから勉強した甲斐がありました。ふふっ♪", "zh": "看来我为了这次的拍摄，从磨咖啡豆开始\n学习怎么泡咖啡是值得的。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "346ba316279e05ce63566b4b560fb32c64bd88850b073c8abf80942410800b45", "ja": "えっ、そんな本格的に？\nすごい気合いですね……。", "zh": "什么？这么讲究吗？\n你好认真啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "70d45188cb83b91ea95011f3901e1e2ba3c24a3c1551a0b59c6d745ab73a7160", "ja": "いえ、あの……\nじつは、ちょっと思うところがあって。", "zh": "不是的，那个……\n其实，是因为我有个目的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "ec5fab21e99c47fa31e862586a7f0eeb18e89b86658e21b477d025cdb8150bde", "ja": "と、とにかく、{$P$}さんも一杯、\nいかがですか？　一応、淹れたてで……。", "zh": "总、总之，{$P$}先生\n要不要也来一杯呢？我才刚泡好没多久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1007_p", "source_sha256": "93acb4c13d4c92df414592e108d8958eaf9bab1d2b179a2f886fd2371ae9d1bb", "ja": "あ、ずっと漂ってるこの香りは、あずささんお手製の\nコーヒーだったわけですね。もちろん、いただきます！", "zh": "啊，原来这股香味是梓小姐亲手泡的咖啡吗？\n那我当然要品尝一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "df904d9c5a06ebe160450ce8d795533f6808f5a5d7394e31cbc277e956d37954", "ja": "……ふぅ～。すごくおいしかったです、あずささん。\nなんだか、身体と頭がすっきりして……。", "zh": "……呼～非常好喝喔，梓小姐。\n感觉身体和脑袋都清醒不少……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e5918e4bb0368e6e9dbfc92fa6d0a69d66f9e0ad353a47c88bc40a4a88a43a37", "ja": "とにかく美味い……。", "zh": "真的很好喝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "92f1c281231fe05b3d0fea41b76764499e28808d149de8e56e6ea7b191629012", "ja": "ふふっ、お粗末さまでした。おかわりも\nたくさんしてもらえたみたいで、よかったです♪", "zh": "呵呵，献丑了。\n你还续了好几杯呢，真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c7a3034ae784c6180ddd5d5071312b63e7c6a719b6253fd012e18fba9e19877c", "ja": "最後は自分で汲んで、飲んでましたからね。\n3杯、いや4杯かな？　本当においしかったです！", "zh": "我最后甚至还自己倒来喝呢。\n大概喝了3、4杯吧？真的好好喝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "7b5b0d4c919265c9cc492efcd483d75cf45ec744e687a35839981eb51867a194", "ja": "ありがとうございます。……あら？", "zh": "谢谢你的夸奖……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "e274bbf1b89a96f87fa13d405ed60b2a1f80570bbfd5ce042bbcb601009bbd2f", "ja": "{$P$}さん？\nあの、コーヒーカップは……どちらに？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？\n请问咖啡杯……在哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2aea0955d0bb49d81198d4581ad04219403bfc048d37a878fcfe4d771c6f2581", "ja": "ああ、飲んでたカップですか？　大丈夫ですよ！\nちゃんと洗って、キッチンに置いてきました。", "zh": "啊，你说我用的咖啡杯吗？放心！\n我已经洗干净，放在厨房了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "72344fbcd3a9b7892dc2f32557a57adeb526376dbee927998a3bd1df28cb3327", "ja": "えっ。……えええええ～～～！？", "zh": "什……什么～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1016_p", "source_sha256": "938886187cf52956433c39ef67d7f76b66c662324fb020aa7fda86420bd64481", "ja": "あ、あれ？　ダメでしたか？", "zh": "怎、怎么了？这样不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "a4aab978124dbd0cacead176050f33b57cb0ee62bf3c459e728d76d99444d857", "ja": "あ、いえ、あの……。\nダメというか……うう……。", "zh": "啊，不是，那个……\n也不是不行……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "f5f1b871fa39b38519142e7ffaf2f63019a88cefbdcf604d9cec9e032436a842", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さんは、\nコーヒー占いって、ご存じですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，\n你知道咖啡占卜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "aeaaf1f1a2aa3945bb12c6d01bbb11497459a1994d3783200389dd38b73c2110", "ja": "コーヒーを飲み終わったカップの底にできる、\n粉の模様で運命を占うというんですけれど……。", "zh": "喝完咖啡后，杯底会留下残渣，\n根据残渣的形状来占卜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1020_p", "source_sha256": "046131a2a4fc2b662b4008de686a98147a8587c73748a8d75d0a15c54d7bfd30", "ja": "そういえば、聞いたことがあるような……はっ！\nもしかして、あずささんが勉強したって言うのは……？", "zh": "经你这么一说，我好像有听过……啊！\n该不会梓小姐刚刚说学泡咖啡也包含了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "774d578ce0927a25be025de9d5f59e0f270b5b334b0bf90f3693001771dcc9ae", "ja": "は、はい……。黙っていてすみません。\n先に言ってしまうと、占いにならないと思って……。", "zh": "是、是的……不好意思，没有告诉你。\n我觉得如果事先知情，占卜就不准了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3b1abc3a7aed8193a51567f1ebc195dec9e80a279bfb400024a6158fe894cd9a", "ja": "いえ、こちらこそ、すいません！\n何だか台無しにしてしまって……。", "zh": "不会的，我才该道歉！\n我好像搞砸了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "7f2803e489effce77c9f831d3ca15803d3178c2e1a25cf2a87be54bd6b001c0f", "ja": "いえ……いいんです。\n考えてみれば、これもきっと、占いの結果ですから。", "zh": "不会……没关系的。\n仔细想想，这一定也是占卜的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "4461e826e3e809dbf4ae5ab246a32507732987e4948c83bb92bbbaa355194513", "ja": "運命を見るのは、まだ早いっていう……。", "zh": "占卜告诉我，要窥探命运还太早了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1025_p", "source_sha256": "60b28fb7c965c26bd98bc981161f70f85ec19fec7a4818e530540c3cd57f922e", "ja": "そうですか……。自分では、\nそんな大層な代物じゃない気もしますが……。", "zh": "是这样吗……\n我觉得应该没有那么夸张吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "06f25acaa752879c79a05ce3edcb741aec4fd0310361b9c9251f78cc9fa6e8c5", "ja": "あ、スタッフの方が呼んで……。\n休憩時間、終わってしまったみたいですね。", "zh": "啊，工作人员在叫我了……\n看来休息时间已经结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "c414acb66f33cf983195567ee30729a0df063a852c29e22d7ff1240b3a83c3b0", "ja": "今は占いよりもお仕事……。\nやっぱり、そういうことなんだと思います。", "zh": "现在比起占卜，还是工作比较要紧……\n我想一定是这样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0064_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "846bb9b8c99a4811de6403275710388fadcbd23572af69a4c51f39ea30b7521f", "ja": "私、がんばってきますね！　水に流されない運命を、\nしっかりとつかむためにも……。ふふっ♪", "zh": "我要去努力工作了！这也是为了抓住\n不会被水冲走的命运……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
